  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Model Project for Complementary Pre-Integration Measures for Beneficiaries of Protection in Resettlement and Humanitarian Admission Programs for their Integration in Germany</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This model project  aims to prepare beneficiaries of protection who have been selected for resettlement or a humanitarian admissions program (HAP) to Germany (hereafter beneficiaries of protection) for their integration process in Germany through testing individual and target-group specific pre-integration measures. The measures seek to complement existing offers and effectively link to integration measures after arrival in Germany.</narrative>
  </description>
